{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於2026年11月19日16時15分發出特別天氣提示，指出受強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶影響，本港今晚及明日天氣顯著轉涼。密雲及有幾陣雨的情況下，明日日間氣溫將持續下降，並伴隨風寒效應。\n</p>\n<p>市民尤其是進行戶外活動的人士需特別留意天氣變化，做好保暖措施。建議穿著保暖衣物，避免長時間暴露於寒冷環境。此外，請關顧家中長者及慢性病患者，確保他們的健康不受寒冷天氣影響。</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民密切留意最新天氣預報，並根據情況調整活動安排，以保障安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e8%bd%89%e6%b6%bc/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣轉涼</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:54:31.259890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:45:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:29:22.372074+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:47:57.299552+00:00","content_hash":"e2894a0b8ad7d80f1b2b88e216f3dca2269597bc567e280b6a423b4e40a5afdb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}